	"title"			"The Second Abjuration"
	"description"		"A Hearts of Iron IV mod in which the Netherlands renounces the monarchy and returns to the Republic of the United Provinces. Features a Regency-vs-Commoners Balance of Power, a shared Commonwealth Council focus tree for the West Indies / East Indies / South Africa, a Colonial Obedience system, progressive national spirits, a reformed military, and Brother Republics. Created by AI (WorkBuddy) together with the mod author."
